        'WORD FIRST / the true Owner: no company owns the stack — "The earth is the LORD\'s, and the fulness thereof" (Psalms 24:1); "by him all things consist" (Colossians 1:17). Every stack is leased from Him. Spoken into the app by the Governor from a forwarded newsletter (The Neuron); captured same session, every verse verbatim KJV.',
        'The headline (as reported, not confirmed — DR-0076): Nvidia (the chips) reported to buy Hugging Face (the model repository + community), the "GitHub of A.I.," for $12.9B — one hand reaching for the whole stack: hardware + models + marketplace.',
