        'The trajectory, soberly: one gate over buy/sell is Scripture\'s final tyranny (Revelation 13:16-17) — we name the DIRECTION, not any one deal. The lane: sovereign, small, free — own what you can, keep an exit from every vendor, trade with a just weight (Proverbs 11:1), refuge in a Name not a cloud (Proverbs 18:10).',
