        '"Ye are the light of the world" — but you do not create the light, you reflect it (Matthew 5:14; John 1:8; 2 Corinthians 4:6). Where have you tried to be a source instead of a reflector — and what changes when the Father of Lights (James 1:17) is the source and you are the city on the hill?',
