  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Week 20 - captured 2026-09-15 by the Gmail-lesson-intake Way (DR-0312):
  // Darrell forwarded (from dpoe@illinois.edu, his Lesson. marker) ByteByteGo
  // of 2026-09-15, Do LLMs Have the Memory of a Goldfish? - the model has no
  // memory of its own; what looks like memory is the APPLICATION placing things
  // back on the desk every call (the context window as a desk, reconstructed
  // memory, lossy summaries and the photocopy-of-a-photocopy drift, structured
  // facts over narrative, retrieval that selects what deserves space, profiles
