  // class: Yahweh remembers His covenant; man forgets and is commanded to WRITE;
  // the Spirit brings all things to remembrance - so a house keeps its covenant
  // in writing and in the Spirit, never in the tool. Word first; every verse
  // verbatim KJV, pinned; every system fact verified against live provider
