        'The photocopy drift is the tradition of men (Mark 7:13); the discipline is precept upon precept read from the page (Isaiah 28:10, 13); the text is exact by decree - John 10:35; Matthew 5:18; Deuteronomy 4:2; Proverbs 30:6; Revelation 22:18-19; Psalms 12:6-7; Isaiah 40:8; Psalms 119:89, 160; Matthew 24:35; certainty over summary - Luke 1:3-4; Acts 17:11; 1 Corinthians 4:6; Proverbs 22:21; Isaiah 8:20. This is why the house fetches every verse verbatim and gates it.',
