      theme: 'KJV: "I am the door: by me if any man enter in, he shall be saved, and shall go in and out, and find pasture." (John 10:9) - the Lamb of Yahweh is the one door of the fold; there is no hidden hatch. And "For the eyes of the LORD run to and fro throughout the whole earth, to shew himself strong in the behalf of them whose heart is perfect toward him." (2 Chronicles 16:9) - the true Watcher sees from where nothing He watches can reach Him. The spine of this week: Genesis 3:24; Genesis 7:16; Genesis 11:6; Proverbs 18:17; John 10:1-2, 11; John 1:29; Nehemiah 13:19; Psalms 141:3; Psalms 125:2; Zechariah 2:5; Proverbs 15:3; Jeremiah 23:24; Psalms 139:7, 12; Leviticus 13:4, 6; Proverbs 17:14; Proverbs 16:32; Romans 13:1; Proverbs 14:15; Acts 17:11; Proverbs 22:7; 1 Kings 21:3; Micah 4:4; Daniel 1:12; Psalms 127:1.',
