      research: 'Pick one A.I. tool or app that can act for you. Find out three things: how it reaches the outside world (its door), what record it keeps of what it did (its watcher), and how you would stop it at once (its quarantine). "The simple believeth every word: but the prudent man looketh well to his going." (Proverbs 14:15)',
