      "theme": "\"A false balance is abomination to the LORD: but a just weight is his delight.\" (Proverbs 11:1) The industry announced open weights; Yahweh has always required a just weight, and the two are not the same test - openness is access, justness is truth. \"But God is the judge: he putteth down one, and setteth up another.\" (Psalms 75:7) So a new player's seat is on loan from the Judge, a trillion parameters is not a foundation, and the artefact anyone may alter is held against the one standard no one may."
